<%--
Snap_List - appends one row in on_load().

The append is the whole point: it is only correct if on_load() always starts from
the on_create() state. A snapshot taken after the cache hydrated this.data makes
the warm-cache run start from ['a'] and end with ['a','a'].
--%>
<Define:Snap_List class="snap-list">
  <span class="count"><%= this.data.items.length %></span>
</Define:Snap_List>
